+ * a name and a backlog instead of an anonymous local name. The firing rule
+ * changed with the reading: boot 19 spent its sixteen fires on one unchanged
+ * receiver, so the sampler now fires on a changed thread/hop set or on a
+ * two-minute heartbeat, and the cap covers the whole boot. Boot 18 and 19 also
+ * kept one backboardd thread in _ulock_wait_continue for the whole generation.
+ * That continuation is a static function, so this side cannot name it; every
+ * waiting thread that is not in the trap is printed with its continuation, pc
+ * and x0-x3 instead, and the host resolves the continuation against the same
+ * kernel's symbol table. x0 is the user lock address the wait started on.
  */
